 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 48.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $61,778M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 24.7%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.59"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":79.59,"default_fair_val":79.59,"premium_pct":80,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":9.3,"pe_forward":8.2,"pb_trailing":6,"pb_forward":5.4,"div_yield":0.14,"ps_ratio":4.1,"fcf_to_ev":11.83,"fcf_to_mcap":6.08,"liab_to_assets":24.7,"cash_to_assets":25,"current_ratio":2.59,"roe":64.7,"roa":48.7,"moat":{"ticker":"SKHY","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 作為全球領先的記憶體晶片製造商，在DRAM和NAND Flash市場擁有強勁的品牌聲譽和技術領先地位。雖然記憶體產業週期性強，價格易受供需影響，但其高端產品（如HBM）的技術壁壘和客戶認可度，使其在特定領域具備一定的定價能力。然而，面對三星、美光等主要競爭對手，其品牌定價權仍受市場結構性因素制約，難以完全獨立於市場週期定價。","comment_en":"SK hynix, a leading global memory chip manufacturer, holds a strong brand reputation and technological edge in DRAM and NAND Flash markets. While the memory industry is cyclical and prices are sensitive to supply/demand, its high-end products (like HBM) possess significant technological barriers and customer recognition, granting it some pricing power in specific segments. However, facing major competitors like Samsung and Micron, its brand pricing power remains constrained by market structure, making it difficult to price independently of market cycles."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"記憶體產業的技術迭代迅速，SK hynix 在關鍵製程技術和產品創新上投入巨資，累積了大量專利。這些專利構成重要的技術壁壘，尤其是在先進製程（如 EUV）和高頻寬記憶體（HBM）等領域，有效阻止競爭對手快速模仿。同時，記憶體製造涉及複雜的生產工藝和嚴格的品質控制，也形成了一定的監管和技術進入門檻。","comment_en":"The memory industry is characterized by rapid technological evolution. SK hynix invests heavily in key process technologies and product innovation, accumulating a substantial patent portfolio. These patents form significant technological barriers, particularly in advanced processes (like EUV) and High Bandwidth Memory (HBM), effectively hindering rapid imitation by competitors. Furthermore, the complex manufacturing processes and stringent quality control in memory production also establish regulatory and technical entry barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於終端客戶（如伺服器、PC、手機製造商）而言，更換記憶體供應商涉及嚴格的產品驗證、系統整合和供應鏈調整，具有一定的轉換成本。特別是對於追求穩定性和高性能的伺服器和高性能計算客戶，一旦選定供應商，通常會維持較長時間的合作關係。然而，相較於軟體或特定平台，記憶體晶片的轉換成本並非絕對高不可攀，尤其是在標準化產品領域。","comment_en":"For end customers (e.g., server, PC, mobile manufacturers), switching memory suppliers involves rigorous product validation, system integration, and supply chain adjustments, incurring certain switching costs. This is particularly true for server and high-performance computing clients prioritizing stability and performance, who tend to maintain long-term relationships once a supplier is chosen. However, compared to software or specific platforms, the switching costs for memory chips are not insurmountable, especially for standardized products."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"記憶體晶片產業的網絡效應非常有限。其價值主要體現在產品性能、成本和可靠性上，而非用戶間的互動或平台效應。雖然與主要客戶（如CPU/GPU大廠）的緊密合作關係有助於產品開發和市場滲透，但這更多是基於技術和供應關係，而非典型的網絡效應壁壘。","comment_en":"Network effects are very limited in the memory chip industry. Value is primarily derived from product performance, cost, and reliability, rather than user interactions or platform effects. While close collaborations with major clients (like CPU/GPU manufacturers) aid product development and market penetration, this stems more from technological and supply relationships than typical network effect barriers."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 作為全球前兩大的記憶體製造商之一，擁有巨大的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的生產規模、先進的製程技術和持續的研發投入，使其在單位生產成本上具備顯著的競爭力。這種規模優勢不僅體現在生產效率上，也體現在其採購原材料和設備時的議價能力，能夠有效抵禦價格競爭，並在市場低迷時維持盈利能力。","comment_en":"As one of the top two global memory manufacturers, SK hynix benefits from immense economies of scale. Its vast production capacity, advanced process technology, and continuous R&D investment provide a significant cost advantage per unit. This scale advantage translates not only into production efficiency but also into strong bargaining power for raw materials and equipment, enabling it to withstand price competition and maintain profitability even during market downturns."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 的生產基地主要集中在韓國和中國，雖然這些地區擁有成熟的半導體產業生態系統，但並非獨一無二的地理資產。其核心競爭力在於技術和製造能力，而非特定地理位置的稀缺性。全球化的供應鏈和潛在的政治風險，使得過度依賴單一地區的地理優勢並不明智。","comment_en":"SK hynix's manufacturing facilities are primarily concentrated in South Korea and China. While these regions possess mature semiconductor industry ecosystems, they do not represent unique geographical assets. Its core competitiveness lies in technology and manufacturing capabilities, not in the scarcity of specific locations. Globalized supply chains and potential geopolitical risks make over-reliance on a single region's geographical advantage unwise."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 在記憶體製造領域展現了卓越的營運效率。透過持續的製程優化、自動化生產和嚴格的品質管理，公司能夠在快速變化的市場中保持領先的生產良率和成本控制。其高 ROE (64.7%) 和 ROA (48.7%) 以及強勁的 FCF TTM ($61,778.4M) 均印證了其卓越的營運管理能力和資本運用效率。","comment_en":"SK hynix demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency in memory manufacturing. Through continuous process optimization, automated production, and stringent quality control, the company maintains leading production yields and cost control in a rapidly changing market. Its high ROE (64.7%) and ROA (48.7%), along with robust FCF TTM ($61,778.4M), attest to its outstanding operational management and capital utilization efficiency."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 的資本配置策略表現出色。公司在保持強勁的研發投入以維持技術領先的同時，也積極進行產能擴張和技術升級。其充裕的現金儲備 ($56,211.9M) 和相對較低的負債 ($13,632.1M) 提供了財務彈性，使其能夠靈活應對市場週期，並在有利時機進行戰略性投資或回購。管理層在資本配置上的審慎和有效性是其長期價值的關鍵。","comment_en":"SK hynix exhibits an excellent capital allocation strategy. While maintaining strong R&D investment to sustain technological leadership, the company actively pursues capacity expansion and technological upgrades. Its ample cash reserves ($56,211.9M) and relatively low debt ($13,632.1M) provide financial flexibility, enabling agile responses to market cycles and strategic investments or buybacks at opportune moments. Management's prudence and effectiveness in capital allocation are key to its long-term value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SK hynix 與其主要客戶（如伺服器大廠、AI晶片公司）建立了長期穩定的合作夥伴關係。由於記憶體產品的技術複雜性和嚴格的驗證流程，一旦客戶採用其產品並整合到其系統中，轉換成本會相對較高，這有助於維持客戶忠誠度。特別是在高成長的 AI 和伺服器領域，其領先的 HBM 技術進一步鞏固了客戶關係。","comment_en":"SK hynix has established long-term, stable partnerships with its key clients (e.g., major server manufacturers, AI chip companies). Given the technical complexity and rigorous validation processes for memory products, switching costs are relatively high once a customer integrates their products into their systems, fostering customer loyalty. This is particularly evident in the high-growth AI and server sectors, where its leading HBM technology further solidifies customer relationships."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"記憶體產業的週期性是其主要的挑戰，但 SK hynix 作為技術領導者，透過持續的技術創新（如 HBM）和對高附加值產品的專注，展現了較強的抗週期能力。其龐大的規模經濟和嚴格的成本控制，使其在行業低谷時仍能維持一定的競爭力。然而，產業的資本密集度和技術快速迭代，意味著其護城河的持久性仍需持續觀察和應對。","comment_en":"The cyclical nature of the memory industry presents a primary challenge. However, as a technology leader, SK hynix demonstrates considerable resilience through continuous innovation (e.g., HBM) and focus on high-value products. Its massive economies of scale and stringent cost controls allow it to maintain competitiveness even during industry downturns. Nevertheless, the capital-intensive nature and rapid technological evolution of the industry mean the durability of its moat requires ongoing observation and adaptation."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"SK hynix 展現了強勁的經濟護城河，主要體現在其顯著的規模經濟（M5）和卓越的營運效率（M7）上，這使其在高度競爭且週期性的記憶體市場中佔據有利地位。其在先進技術（如 HBM）上的專利壁壘（M2）和與關鍵客戶的穩固關係（M9）進一步加強了其競爭優勢。儘管網絡效應（M4）薄弱，但其在資本配置（M8）上的審慎和有效性，以及相對較高的轉換成本（M3），共同構建了一個堅實的護城河結構。整體而言，SK hynix 類似於一個技術驅動的「收費橋」，在關鍵的半導體供應鏈中扮演著不可或缺的角色，其護城河雖受產業週期影響，但在技術領先和成本控制方面具備持久的競爭力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"SK hynix possesses a robust economic moat, primarily driven by significant economies of scale (M5) and exceptional operational efficiency (M7), positioning it strongly in the highly competitive and cyclical memory market. Its patent barriers in advanced technologies like HBM (M2) and stable relationships with key clients (M9) further enhance its competitive edge. While network effects (M4) are weak, prudent and effective capital allocation (M8) and relatively high switching costs (M3) collectively form a solid moat structure. Overall, SK hynix operates like a technology-driven 'toll bridge' within the critical semiconductor supply chain. Its moat, though subject to industry cycles, exhibits durability through technological leadership and cost control.","evidenceHash":"dd7599310ed6bbf9d993c2999c2df75b9a32d21c2fc6f8d6e44b057950a40a70","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKHY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SKHY.png","website":"https://www.skhynix.com","ceo":"Noh-Jung Kwak","full_time_employees":"36042","description":"SK hynix is one of the world's largest memory semiconductor companies and engages in the design, manufacture, and sale of advanced memory semiconductors. The company sells a wide variety of DRAM and NAND flash memory products with various configurations and performance characteristics tailored to meet application- and customer-specific needs.","description_en":"SK hynix is one of the world's largest memory semiconductor companies and engages in the design, manufacture, and sale of advanced memory semiconductors. The company sells a wide variety of DRAM and NAND flash memory products with various configurations and performance characteristics tailored to meet application- and customer-specific needs.","description_zh":"好的，身為資深證券分析師，我將為您翻譯並精煉 SK hynix Inc. (SKHY) 的官方業務營運描述，並採用繁體中文（台灣財經用語）：\n\n**SK hynix Inc. (SKHY) 業務營運概述**\n\nSK hynix 為全球頂尖的記憶體半導體領導廠商之一，專注於先進記憶體半導體的設計、製造與銷售。公司提供多元化的動態隨機存取記憶體 (DRAM) 及儲存型快閃記憶體 (NAND Flash) 產品，這些產品具備多樣化的規格與效能表現，旨在滿足不同應用領域及客戶的特定需求。\n\nSK hynix 的核心業務涵蓋了從晶圓製造到封裝測試的完整價值鏈，並持續投入研發，以掌握下一世代的記憶體技術，例如高頻寬記憶體 (HBM) 及先進的 3D NAND 架構。其營運模式著重於技術創新與規模經濟，透過與主要客戶建立緊密合作關係，確保產品能有效導入至伺服器、個人電腦、智慧型手機、汽車電子及物聯網等廣泛應用市場，進而鞏固其在全球記憶體產業的領先地位。","address":"2091, Gyeongchung-daero, Bubal-eup","city":"Icheon-Si","state":"GY","zip":"17336","country":"KR","phone":null,"full_address":"2091, Gyeongchung-daero, Bubal-eup, Icheon-Si, GY 17336, KR","range_52w":"124.8-199.87","year_high":199.87,"year_low":124.8,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":124.8,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"SKHY","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"SK hynix Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T13:02:55.720Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/SKHY.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
